      "side": 1,
      "message": "This curve is used for categorizing RSSI levels into different buckets for scoring purpose.\n\n1) Not sure if we need to define each number used here. RSSI_SCORE itself is a \"constant\" and the numbers are not used by others.  Also each number are commented.\n\n2) Any RSSI lower than the start value (-80) will be returned with a score belong to the lowest bucket (-10).  So the start value doesn\u0027t have to be in sync with the lowest RSSI allowed.\n\n3) The purpose of this curve is for converting RSSI level into a score.  I don\u0027t think it is necessary to make the curve values device dependent.\n\nI would prefer to leave it as is for now.  Let me know what you think?",
